    DialogueAsset: {fileID: 4900000, guid: ac68b47203cbb354991ab739c974e56d, type: 3}
    HasBreakPoint: 0
    TutorialSteps:
    - message: Look upon these Vetruni training for their upcoming battle. They wield
        the wind powers of forest spirits and are able to <b>push others</b> in battle.If
        you wish to see their ability, <b>right-click</b> on them or their portrait
        to access their <b>Information Panel</b>.<br> Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: Their decisions are yours to order, within the <b>Turn Order Bar</b>.
        <b>Drag the portraits</b> of the mages in the order you wish them to take.<br>
        Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 1
    - message: <b>Hovering</b> over portraits or units shows you a preview of their
        action. You can <b>left-click</b> to lock in the preview and click again
        to unlock it.<br> Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: This is your <b>main objective</b> for this event, the <b>Fated Goal</b>.
        To succeed, you must fulfill it.<br> Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: When you are ready to see your choices transpire, <b>press</b> the
        <b>Play</b> button.<br> Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 1
    - message: If you want to try another strategy, <b>press</b> the <b>Restart</b>
        button.<br> Click to dismiss.
      uiElement: 0
